*name C06LOW
*call yesmemory
*perso:602300
*no list
*forex
c---- C6 lowered: EQV/NEQV via AND/OR/NOT (C5 primitives).
      PROGRAM C06LOW
      LOGICAL A,B,R,S
      A=.TRUE.
      B=.FALSE.
C@ A .EQV. B -> (A .AND. B) .OR. (.NOT.A .AND. .NOT.B)
      R=(A .AND. B) .OR. (.NOT.A .AND. .NOT.B)
C@ A .NEQV. B -> (A .AND. .NOT.B) .OR. (.NOT.A .AND. B)
      S=(A .AND. .NOT.B) .OR. (.NOT.A .AND. B)
      IR=0
      IF (R) IR=1
      IS=0
      IF (S) IS=1
      PRINT 10,IR,IS
   10 FORMAT(1X,2I3)
      STOP
      END
*execute
*end file
``````
